From ccc7964e428ab427cb20bfe751192601dc8e1451 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jason-liu-4980 <38558962+jason-liu-4980@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:30:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] arm64: support SY108 RTC boot state and runtime lease

Record bounded early RTC checkpoints before the ADI driver takes ownership. Add kernel-owned runtime lease, upgrade-window and reboot transitions for both main and Recovery operation, and SC2730 power-off preparation. Keep the established RTC state contract with the boot loader and userspace supervisor.
